              "value": "Bay"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(auditory, concentrate, divine, enchantment, fear, mental)\n\nThe yeth hound emits an unearthly howl audible up to 300 feet away. Any nonfiend creature that hears the howl must succeed at a 20 Will save or become frightened 1. Any creature that critically fails and is within 60 feet of the yeth hound is instead frightened 3 and fleeing for 1d4 rounds (or until it recovers from its frightened condition). Whether it succeeds or fails the saving throw, the creature is then temporarily immune to Bay for 24 hours."
            },
